          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "costume",
            "ref": "v-costume"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " play.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cosplayers dress up as their favourite "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "characters",
            "ref": "v-character"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " from books, films, or TV shows. They also speak and act like the characters they "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "represent",
            "zh": "代表"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". And they sometimes "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "act out",
            "zh": "将……表演出来"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " their favourite "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "scenes",
            "zh": "片段"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cosplay started in Japan in the 1970s. Then it "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "spread",
            "ref": "v-spread"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to other places all over the world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "In recent years",
            "zh": "近年来"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", cosplay has become more and more "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "popular",
            "zh": "流行的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in China. You can see cosplayers at clubs, cinemas, parks, and many other places. They get together to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "celebrate",
            "zh": "庆祝"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " the things they enjoy."
          }
        ]
